_observed_implies\":\"A correlated episode resolves CQ5's harder conjunct and takes CQ5 from 29 to roughly the conjunct-A marginal of ~0.45-0.55, and simultaneously raises CQ6-C by ~5 pts (fiscal-dominance/term-premium transmission is live) and lifts my CQ4 P90. A sharp flight-to-quality rally of >=150 bp instead confirms the disinflationary-bust mechanism: cut CQ5 to ~18, cut CQ4 P50 by ~20 bp, and move ~5 pts from CQ6-C into CQ6-D.\"}","updateBasis":{"kind":"launch","note":"run1 wave 2 fermi seat, effort 'growth'."}}